{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_956.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"d0d01290475faa93607828b2d67ae788229464ef7632594401c17a11bbff50dd","ja":"それもロコアートだって思うから、特別レッスンの\n前に、少しでもイメージをつかんでおきたくって！","zh":"因为我觉得那也是ROCO艺术，所以想在特别课程之前先抓住一点感觉！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_956.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f660a5716b1ac3ddd10048122a8f7fed297ffb157ee69edbe73a2a69e439f2b3","ja":"そうですね。特別レッスンでいっぱい覚えられるように\n準備しておきたいです。ふふ、ワクワクしてきました♪","zh":"是啊。为了能在特别课程里学到更多\n我想先做好准备。呵呵，开始兴奋起来了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_956.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4b089811f463879405eb0461719dfef903206d5a17dea759e5be44434479f470","ja":"セリカ……一緒に頑張りましょう！","zh":"セリカ……一起加油吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
