{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_956.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"878858cb5c7c97c333d316faa587b5d1078d0b99acaf05efdebe8d9aecaefbec","ja":"ふふ、「悩むのを忘れるくらい体を動かしてみる」\n……海美ちゃんの提案、ばっちりだったわね。","zh":"呵呵，「试着动动身体，把烦恼都忘掉」\n……海美的提议，真是说到点子上了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_956.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"9febfb00ed3fcc32d334cc54c007c31b399dec79d8323f767ec3f03f388d2c2e","ja":"うん！　悩みを解決するにはやっぱり運動だよね！\n特別レッスン、みんなで楽しく受けられそう☆","zh":"嗯！要解决烦恼果然还是得靠运动呢！\n特别课程，大家应该都能愉快地参加☆","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
